Description: OpenTelemetry Python web util
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package provides shared HTTP utility helpers (URL sanitization,
 method/status-code normalization) used by OpenTelemetry Python HTTP
 instrumentations such as opentelemetry-instrumentation-asgi and
 opentelemetry-instrumentation-httpx.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
